  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v7.0.0-rc1 — Full SQL fluent API: Q.New() entry point (renamed from Q.Build()), optional self-join alias support on all clauses, UNION/INTERSECT/EXCEPT, CTEs, CASE WHEN, EXISTS, BETWEEN, IS NULL, paging (ROW_NUMBER, OFFSET/FETCH, LIMIT/OFFSET), all 5 JOIN types, GROUP BY, HAVING, ORDER BY, and parameterization throughout. See https://github.com/nyingimaina/Jattac.Libraries.QBuilder/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md for full details.",
